# T-215 / DEF-303 — the daily expense-envelope roll-forward. INSTALL INSTRUCTIONS: docs/ops/README.md
#
# ⛔ Runs as a `system` principal with no session and no person. T-140's decision, unchanged:
# a service account holding an admin role is a standing credential nobody watches.
#
# ⭐ What it is for: a spending cap that has to be re-typed every month is a cap that stops existing
# in the second month. This job moves a daily/weekly/bi-weekly budget's window forward, and creates
# the next row for a monthly/quarterly/annually one — only once that period has actually arrived.

[Unit]
Description=Shareat — daily expense-budget reissue (T-215 / DEF-303)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target
# No After=postgresql.service — the database is DO Managed Postgres, off-box (ADR-002 §1).

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/srv/shareat
ExecStart=/usr/bin/npm run budget-reissue
User=shareat
Group=shareat

# ⚠️ NEVER build here. This is a 2 GB droplet; a build OOMs it. This unit runs an
# already-installed tree shipped by CI — bible §2.10.
Environment=NODE_ENV=production

# ⭐ The exit code is load-bearing: non-zero when anything failed, so the host's mailer speaks up.
StandardOutput=append:/var/log/shareat/budget-reissue.log
StandardError=append:/var/log/shareat/budget-reissue.log
